  "name": "Cauliflower and Broccoli Soup",
  "subtitle": "A savory vegetable soup with a crisp seed-and-crumb topping",
  "description": "Cook cauliflower and broccoli with aromatic vegetables, cumin, coriander, and stock, then blend until smooth and finish with toasted crumbs, seeds, chilli, and grated cheese.",
